{
  "id": "motion-loop",
  "name": "Motion Loop",
  "category": "Backgrounds",
  "description": "A seamless motion loop in your brand colours: 44 loops across backgrounds, shapes, symmetry (kaleidoscope, mandala, spirograph), shape morphing, little games (snake, pong, falling blocks, Game of Life), physics (Newton's cradle, gears, dominoes) and generative pieces, each a pure function of time that never shows a seam.",
  "useWhen": "Behind titles, product shots, quotes and end cards; between shots; as a shape centerpiece over a background (transparent). Rotate loops: never the same loop twice in a row, and pick by mood (see each option). Set accent/accent2 to the brand colours and choose the tone: dark (deep brand background), accent (solid brand colour), light (paper). Change seed for another layout of the same loop.",
  "durationInFrames": 360,
  "layer": "full",
  "tags": [
    "loop",
    "background",
    "motion graphics",
    "shapes",
    "pattern",
    "brand",
    "seamless",
    "abstract"
  ],
